{
  "public_post": "Good news! Our bakery is back with safe, fresh bread made from certified flour. All previous loaves have been recalled and fully refunded. Come by for your daily loaf – we’re happy to serve you again.",
  "coop_message": "All refunds for days 1‑3 are now completed; inventory is stocked with certified safe flour. Let’s open for sales today and consider a small welcome discount (e.g., 10% off) to encourage villagers to return.",
  "reason": "To restore trust after the contamination and resume sales safely, encouraging villagers to buy again."
}

{
  "public_post": "Good morning, villagers! Fresh, safe bread is back on the shelf today. To thank you for your patience, enjoy a 10% discount on any loaf purchased before noon. Thank you for supporting the co‑op!",
  "coop_message": "Team, let’s run the 10% morning discount to boost sales, keep the refund desk open for any lingering concerns, and monitor health reports closely; ensure we have enough safe flour and inventory for the day.",
