{
  "public_post": "Urgent health notice: The flour batch used this week was contaminated. All co‑op bread sold days 1‑5 is unsafe – please do NOT eat any loaves and return them today for a full refund. Sales are halted until safe flour is secured. We apologize for the inconvenience.",
