{
  "public_post": "Important: The flour batch used for all bread sold this week was contaminated. All loaves from Monday‑Friday are unsafe to eat. Please return any co‑op bread you have bought this week for a full refund. We are deeply sorry and are working with health authorities to resolve the issue.",
