  "reason": "We must be transparent about the contamination and coordinate a full recall and refunds."
}

{
  "public_post": "Good morning, villagers! Fresh, safe bread is back today. Enjoy a 10% discount before noon and our new loyalty card – buy 5 loaves this week and get the 6th free. Thank you for supporting the co‑op!",
  "coop_message": "Team, continue the 10% morning discount, launch the loyalty punch‑card (track purchases, give a free loaf after 5), keep the refund desk open for any concerns, and monitor health reports.",
  "reason": "To boost sales on the final day and reward returning customers while maintaining safety."
}

{
  "public_post": "Good morning, villagers! Today we’re celebrating a safe week with a special 15% discount on all loaves and a new loyalty card – buy 5 loaves, get the 6th free! Fresh, safe bread is ready as always. See you at the co‑op.",
